      objectReference: {fileID: 8746363622871845489}
    - target: {fileID: 1226342828346997407, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: buttonToShow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2164158483700881158}
    - target: {fileID: 1226342828346997407, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: changeInterval
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1226342828346997407, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textContents.Array.size
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1226342828346997407, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textContents.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Ces \xE9clairages de s\xE9curit\xE9 servent \xE0 s'orienter et \xE0
        indiquer les voies de secours en cas d'incident provoquant l'obscurit\xE9."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1440775680691222291, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: displayImage
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8170823482315119211}
    - target: {fileID: 1440775680691222291, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: imageContainer
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1005797526316859526}
    - target: {fileID: 1440775680691222291, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: maxContainerSize
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 7642383711460616958}
    - target: {fileID: 2170510584085285613, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: canvas
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8052860308392303817}
    - target: {fileID: 2170510584085285613, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: displayText
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8746363622871845489}
    - target: {fileID: 2170510584085285613, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: buttonToShow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2164158483700881158}
    - target: {fileID: 2170510584085285613, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: changeInterval
      value: 12
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2170510584085285613, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textContents.Array.size
      value: 5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2170510584085285613, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textContents.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Elle sert principalement \xE0 d\xE9tecter un d\xE9but d'incendie et
        \xE0 avertir rapidement les occupants d'un b\xE2timent afin qu'ils puissent
        \xE9vacuer en toute s\xE9curit\xE9."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2170510584085285613, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textContents.Array.data[1]'
      value: " Elle joue un r\xF4le crucial dans la pr\xE9vention des incendies et
        la protection des vies et des biens. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2170510584085285613, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textContents.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Celle-ci doit toujours \xEAtre d\xE9clench\xE9e en priorit\xE9 en cas
        d\u2019incendie pour pouvoir pr\xE9venir tout le monde rapidement. De plus,
        dans ce b\xE2timent, celle-ci est li\xE9e aux d\xE9tecteurs de fum\xE9e et
        au num\xE9ro des pompiers."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2170510584085285613, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textContents.Array.data[3]'
      value: "Dans d\u2019autres b\xE2timents, elle pourrait permettre de d\xE9verrouiller
        les issues de secours. Ainsi, \xE0 cause de toutes ces variables possibles,
        l\u2019alarme doit toujours \xEAtre manuellement d\xE9clench\xE9e, et tu
        dois appeler les pompiers d\xE8s que ta vie n\u2019est plus en danger. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2170510584085285613, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textContents.Array.data[4]'
      value: "Une caract\xE9ristique importante des alarmes incendie est le voyant
        lumineux, qui fournit des informations cruciales sur l'\xE9tat et le fonctionnement
        de l'alarme."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2490763061763603747, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: autoPlay
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2490763061763603747, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: displayImage
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8170823482315119211}
    - target: {fileID: 2490763061763603747, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: imageContainer
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1005797526316859526}
    - target: {fileID: 2490763061763603747, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: maxContainerSize
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 7642383711460616958}
    - target: {fileID: 2490763061763603747, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'texturePaths.Array.data[0]'
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1c6d13ee576f4b94aa8ddd4c443ed6cc, type: 3}
    - target: {fileID: 2561209366234319849, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: canvas
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8052860308392303817}
    - target: {fileID: 2561209366234319849, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: displayText
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 8746363622871845489}
    - target: {fileID: 2561209366234319849, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: buttonToShow
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2164158483700881158}
    - target: {fileID: 2561209366234319849, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: changeInterval
      value: 10
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2561209366234319849, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: textContents.Array.size
      value: 2
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2561209366234319849, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textContents.Array.data[0]'
      value: "Ceci est un panneau d'\xE9vacuation, il montre la direction de la sortie
        de secours la plus proche"
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2561209366234319849, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textContents.Array.data[1]'
      value: "Suis moi, on va rejoindre la sortie de secours tout droit o\xF9 on
        va retrouver le prochain \xE9l\xE9ment : une porte coupe-feu. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2561209366234319849, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'textContents.Array.data[2]'
      value: "Enfin, plus loin, tu retrouves l\u2019alarme incendie. Celle-ci doit
        toujours \xEAtre d\xE9clench\xE9e en priorit\xE9 en cas d\u2019incendie pour
        pouvoir pr\xE9venir tout le monde rapidement. De plus, dans ce b\xE2timent,
        celle-ci est li\xE9e aux d\xE9tecteurs de fum\xE9e et au num\xE9ro des pompiers.
        M\xEAme dans d\u2019autres b\xE2timents, elle permet de d\xE9verrouiller
        les issues de secours. Ainsi, \xE0 cause de toutes ces variables possibles,
        l\u2019alarme doit toujours \xEAtre manuellement d\xE9clench\xE9e, et tu
        dois appeler les pompiers d\xE8s que ta vie n\u2019est plus en danger. "
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 2741690341026141596, guid: f30e7d6744b9d6e4e89103e86099de3a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_IsActive
      value: 0
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
